<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3346 0 R
/E (Peer Comparison: Avenue Supermarts maintains a remarkably stable and low gross margin of approximately 15% to 16%, reflecting its "Everyday Low Price" \(EDLP\) business model. In contrast, Reliance Retail leads the group with the highest margins, consistently staying between 33% and 35%, likely due to a product mix that includes higher-margin fashion and electronics. Vishal Mega Mart holds the middle ground with margins between 27% and 28.5%, showing a slight upward trend toward January 2025. V-Mart operates at the lowest margin level in this set, remaining relatively flat around 13.5% throughout the observed period. Overall, the data reveals that while its competitors maintain higher or more varied margins, Avenue Supermarts prioritizes consistency and cost-leadership over high markups.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
